    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"personal development\" sounds like a joke. i'm not talking about learning a new hobby or being \"the best version of myself.\" i mean the actual drive that made me feel like i mattered. it's gone. now it's just this constant, heavy realization that i'm just... middle of the road. and the middle is so boring. it's like being stuck in a waiting room for a life that isn't even happening. how am i supposed to find \"satisfaction\" in just being nothing special?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
